line=579 timestamp=2026-07-23T03:33:15.699Z record_type=event_msg payload={"memory_citation": null, "message": "The universal entry-point claim now closes with `#Top`. The proof uses the reference semantics for function setup, indexing, float comparisons, branching, assignments, tuple construction, and return; only the unbounded float loop is summarized by a proof-domain symbol, mirroring the supplied semantics’ own opaque-float pattern. I’m adding concrete equations that tie that symbol back to the recursive exhaustive scan, then I’ll run the final script end to end.", "phase": "commentary", "type": "agent_message"}
